      "hizbQuarter": 24,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 379,
      "text": "How would Allah guide a people who disbelieved after having believed and testified that the Messenger was true, and the clear signs had come to them? For Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 3,
        "name": "سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ",
        "englishName": "Aal-i-Imraan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Family of Imraan",
        "numberOfAyahs": 200,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 3,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 61,
      "ruku": 50,
      "hizbQuarter": 24,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 380,
      "text": "The punishment of such people is that they are cursed by Allah, the angels, and all mankind.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 3,
        "name": "سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ",
        "englishName": "Aal-i-Imraan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Family of Imraan",
        "numberOfAyahs": 200,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 3,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 61,
      "ruku": 50,
      "hizbQuarter": 24,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 381,
      "text": "They will abide therein forever. Their punishment will neither be lightened, nor will they be given respite,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 3,
        "name": "سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ",
        "englishName": "Aal-i-Imraan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Family of Imraan",
        "numberOfAyahs": 200,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
